    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28860" root="عرن" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْنَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَنٌ</span>, former half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْنَتَانِ</span> signifies
<i>Two specks,</i> or <i>spots, above the eye of a dog:</i> so
in a trad. in which men are commanded to kill
every dog that is entirely black having <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عرنتان</span>.
(TA.)

